  "body": "Found in the review of PR #3532. The removal kernel makes four buffers and one bind group for each batch and drops them after it (`crates/gpu/src/cut_gpu.rs`). This is not a leak. It costs time for each batch.\n\nWanted: keep the buffers and the bind group in the kernel object and make them again only when the size changes. Give the time for one batch before and after. Do this with the work of #2629, or after it.\n",
